# --- Rust / Solana program build artifacts ---
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.so
# Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored — dependency hygiene
# requires lockfiles committed.

# --- Node / TypeScript CLI build artifacts ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
# package-lock.json / yarn.lock intentionally NOT ignored — same lockfile requirement.

# --- Solana local test validator / Anchor tooling ---
test-ledger/
.anchor/

# --- Transient admin-tx lifecycle artifacts (partially/fully-signed txs; never committed) ---
admin-tx-*.json

# --- Keypairs and other secret material — never commit these, not even devnet placeholders ---
*keypair*.json
# Belt-and-suspenders over *keypair*.json: every JSON key file in the secrets dir
keys/*.json
**/id.json
*.pem
.env
.env.*
elgamal*.json
# Location, not filename: nothing under keys/ is ever committed, whatever it is called
keys/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# NOTE: this repo intentionally does NOT blanket-ignore *.log — evidence artifacts
# (devnet run logs, benchmark output) are deliverables, not build noise. Only
# npm/yarn's own debug logs are excluded above.

# Rust build artifacts (nested helper crates, e.g. scripts/decode_mint_metadata)
**/target/

# Python bytecode cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
